   "text": "LaSalle College Vancouver (Undergraduate) - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nLaSalle College Vancouver (Undergraduate)\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nLaSalle College Vancouver is a boutique-design school offering applied arts programs that help graduates build rewarding, lifelong careers. We offer Vancouver’s quickest and most affordable Associate of Arts degree. We provide an on-the-job learning experience with a 50/50 classroom-to-lab or studio-split and cross-program collaboration, so students emerge ready for real-world success. Our Game Design program have been ranked #1 school in Canada for 10 years in a row. As part of an international education network, our graduates are hired by industry-leading organizations worldwide. With small class sizes &amp; award-winning instructors, LaSalle College Vancouver is a place where creative dreams come to life.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 05:10\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n27/03/2026 05:10\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nCanada\nYearly Fees\nMax: CA$8,250.00\nMin: CA$6,600.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n60%\n1,440 of 2,400 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1979\nCampus(es)\nVancouver\nCountry\nCanada\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n21/03/2024\nContract End Date\n31/12/2026\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.lasallecollegevancouver.com/student-resources/housing\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.lasallecollegevancouver.com/future-students/scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2p93J7xVZCs\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
